# ripgrep's defaults for this repository (see swarm/docs/design/search-discipline.md).
#
# `rg` skips these without a flag; `grep -r`, `find` and `fd` do not, which is why the rule is
# enforced at the tool call instead of being left to a rememberable flag list.
node_modules/
.git/
orca/out/
orca/dist/
*.png
*.bench-fixtures/
